    "societal_benefit": {
      "en": "An open, made-to-measure jinbei jacket keeps a light, breathable heritage garment makeable from a few straight-seamed rectangles — dressed with simple side ties rather than fastenings — with the sashiko and indigo finishing left to the maker rather than sold back.",
      "es": "Una chaqueta jinbei abierta y a la medida mantiene una prenda patrimonial ligera y transpirable fabricable a partir de unos pocos rectángulos de costura recta — vestida con simples lazos laterales en lugar de cierres — con el acabado sashiko e índigo en manos de quien elabora, no revendido."
    },
